{"page":282,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:1","surah":17,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" سُبْحَـٰنَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَسْرَىٰ بِعَبْدِهِۦ لَيْلًا مِّنَ ٱلْمَسْجِدِ ٱلْحَرَامِ إِلَى ٱلْمَسْجِدِ ٱلْأَقْصَا ٱلَّذِى بَـٰرَكْنَا حَوْلَهُۥ لِنُرِيَهُۥ مِنْ ءَايَـٰتِنَآ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْبَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Glory to Him who made His servant travel by night from the sacred place of worship to the furthest place of worship, whose surroundings We have blessed, to show him some of Our signs: He alone is the All Hearing, the All Seeing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سُبْحَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"Exalted","transliteration":"sub'ḥāna","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَسْرَىٰ","en_gloss":"took","transliteration":"asrā","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِعَبْدِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His servant","transliteration":"biʿabdihi","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَيْلًۭا","en_gloss":"(by) night","transliteration":"laylan","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","en_gloss":"Al-Masjid Al-Haraam","transliteration":"l-masjidi","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْحَرَامِ","en_gloss":"Al-Masjid Al-Haraam","transliteration":"l-ḥarāmi","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","en_gloss":"Al-Masjid Al-Aqsa","transliteration":"l-masjidi","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأَقْصَا","en_gloss":"Al-Masjid Al-Aqsa","transliteration":"l-aqṣā","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَـٰرَكْنَا","en_gloss":"We blessed","transliteration":"bāraknā","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حَوْلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"its surroundings","transliteration":"ḥawlahu","verse_key":"17:1"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِنُرِيَهُۥ","en_gloss":"that We may show hi